A) Expect bugs, wipes, and missing features!","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5a75cb37906fa1a4fe7766cd251186ae/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3aa40731ef62a62edd73aa9c100d46ea/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6e8ff7928f6a4f529b978e9c1144470d/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}